  "limitations": [
    "Only synthetic empty vehicles; no sample, rack handoff or material ledger.",
    "Building XY and vertical geometry are presentation assumptions, not a surveyed registration.",
    "Anonymous first-return scans are idealized and not qualified sensor hardware. An obstacle next to known static geometry can be masked by map matching.",
    "No people in v1; free walkthrough camera is not an obstacle. No real person-safety qualification.",
    "Route doors must be open at start; closing a route door freezes the entire compiled preview. No real door automation.",
    "No network, ROS or hardware execution. Camera images are synthetic scene renders, not image recognition.",
    "Human comparison and real-world navigation remain open. K0_013 is deferred by explicit owner decision; staircore exclusion is retained.",
    "The owner-authorized separate BF01 L01 connector preserves canonical bench zones; original L01 routes remain unchanged.",
    "R1 accepts gaps up to15 presentation mm by conservative disk closing; R2 derives the lift-only support height from source sill/floor geometry. These owner assumptions do not qualify real wheels or step traversal; the whole footprint, open edges, active ports, cabin FK and fully open doors remain checked."
